The original game
-----------------
OpenTrail is a reimplementation of The Oregon Trail (MECC, Apple II, 1985,
version 1.4). The original game's content is published here with the
permission of its rights holder and is NOT covered by the MIT License:

- legacy/extracted/: the files from the original disks (MECC's BASIC
  programs, data, pictures, tunes and text);
- legacy/memory/: MECC's machine code from the booted game (the ampersand
  extension and the hunting game; everything else is blanked);
- assets/*.bin: the original data files built from the two above;
- the game's text, rules and data as ported into src/engine/ and src/legacy/.

The Oregon Trail is a trademark of its owner. OpenTrail is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the trademark owner or by Apple Inc. No Apple software (ROM,
DOS or otherwise) is included.

The modern mode's pictures (assets/modern/, art/) were made for this project,
with Retro Diffusion and in code (tools/art.py), and are covered by the MIT
License.

